      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can communicate the dietary requirements effectively by creating a detailed note or memo that specifies the severe nut allergies and vegan requests, including any accommodations needed, such as separate food preparation and labeling. Send the note to the catering kitchen staff in advance, so they can plan accordingly. Also, consider creating a master label list for the buffet, including clear labels and indicators to distinguish between nut-free, vegan, and other special dietary options.",
